<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33599" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑλέπολις</span></b> , poet. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑλέπτολις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ι</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>city-destroying</i>, epith. of Helen, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				689
			</span></i>(lyr.); of Iphigenia, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IA</u>
				1476
			</span></i>(lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				1511
			</span></i>(lyr.); of Lamia, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
				303
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> fem.
				Subst., <i>engine for sieges</i>, invented by
			Demetrius Poliorcetes, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				20.48
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Demetr.</u>
				21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				95.39
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Vitr.
				10.16.4
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνευ μηχανῆς καὶ
			ἑ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				3.45
			</span></i>: pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑ. μηχαναί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					9.68
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph., of a
			person, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑ. τῆς Ἑλλάδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					11
				</span></i>
			; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τῶν ἀνοσίων ἑ.
			τοῦτο</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πένθος</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.191
			</span></i>.</div>
